---
// Section indicator sidebar (left side)
---

<aside class="fixed left-8 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-50 hidden lg:flex flex-col gap-3">
  <span class="indicator-line w-8 h-0.5 bg-base-300 transition-all duration-300 active" data-index="0"></span>
  <span class="indicator-line w-6 h-0.5 bg-base-300 transition-all duration-300" data-index="1"></span>
  <span class="indicator-line w-6 h-0.5 bg-base-300 transition-all duration-300" data-index="2"></span>
  <span class="indicator-line w-6 h-0.5 bg-base-300 transition-all duration-300" data-index="3"></span>
</aside>

<style>
  .indicator-line.active {
    width: 2rem;
    background-color: oklch(var(--color-base-content)) !important;
  }
</style>
